WORD LISTS

The files in data/words/ are derived from the sources below. The selection of answers, the reviewed approved and excluded lists in tools/words/ and the order of the lists are part of this project. tools/words/fetch_sources.sh downloads each source at a fixed commit and checks it against tools/words/sources.sha256.

- Portuguese words and frequency: fserb/pt-br, https://github.com/fserb/pt-br, MIT License, Copyright 2021 Fernando Serboncini.
- English guesses: dwyl/english-words, https://github.com/dwyl/english-words, The Unlicense.
- Spanish guesses: an-array-of-spanish-words, https://github.com/words/an-array-of-spanish-words, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2016 Zeke Sikelianos.
- English and Spanish frequency: FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave, https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, content licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). It was used to rank and select answers, which were then filtered and reviewed. The resulting lists are distributed under GPL-3.0 as allowed by the CC BY-SA 4.0 compatibility with GPLv3.

Used only to filter words during generation, and not distributed: wooorm/dictionaries (Hunspell base forms) and LDNOOBW's list of offensive words (CC BY 4.0).

